  <bpmn:process id="member-process" name="A member, signed in" isExecutable="false">
    <bpmn:documentation>Somebody with an account: a username and a password or Google. Everything a visitor can do, plus saves that follow them, lists of their own, keeping other people's lists, walking a list and checking in at its places, the bike rides they recorded in the iPhone app, discount codes, a page under their name, posts on the blog, and flashcards (drawn on its own). A save, a keep and a discount happen where they are; everything else starts on the account page.</bpmn:documentation>
